WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:29.384
One day Tom walked around the palace.

2
00:00:29.385 --> 00:00:34.588
Cat was hiding in his pocket.

3
00:00:34.589 --> 00:00:38.679
"I love being the royal wizard," Tom said.

4
00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:41.756
"I love the palace too," Cat said.

5
00:00:41.757 --> 00:00:43.757
"There are lots of mice.

6
00:00:43.647 --> 00:00:46.616
And Cook gives me treats."

7
00:00:46.617 --> 00:00:53.964
"Too bad you make the queen sneeze," Tom said.

8
00:00:53.965 --> 00:01:02.414
Just then Tom spotted the royal carriage.

9
00:01:02.415 --> 00:01:05.805
The royal family was going on a trip.

10
00:01:05.806 --> 00:01:11.702
Tom went to say good-bye.

11
00:01:11.703 --> 00:01:14.863
The king and queen waved to everyone.

12
00:01:14.864 --> 00:01:17.494
"Good-bye!" called the queen.

13
00:01:17.495 --> 00:01:23.438
"See you in two days," said the king.

14
00:01:23.439 --> 00:01:32.705
Dirk was carrying a trunk.

15
00:01:32.706 --> 00:01:35.860
He bumped into Tom hard.

16
00:01:35.861 --> 00:01:38.794
"I'm going with them," Dirk whispered.

17
00:01:38.795 --> 00:01:42.080
"But when I come back . . ."

18
00:01:42.081 --> 00:01:43.652
Tom gulped.

19
00:01:43.653 --> 00:01:52.142
"I'm going to tell everyone about that cat!"

20
00:01:52.143 --> 00:01:55.308
Dirk put his trunk on a big pile.

21
00:01:55.309 --> 00:02:03.211
Then he climbed into the carriage.

22
00:02:03.212 --> 00:02:07.222
"Dirk wants to get rid of me," Tom thought.

23
00:02:07.223 --> 00:02:10.475
"This time his plan is going to work.

24
00:02:10.476 --> 00:02:16.107
What am I going to do?"

25
00:02:16.108 --> 00:02:24.288
Soon the carriage was gone.

26
00:02:24.289 --> 00:02:27.944
The servants were happy.

27
00:02:27.945 --> 00:02:31.459
"We still have our work," said Cook.

28
00:02:31.460 --> 00:02:34.828
"But we can have fun too!"

29
00:02:34.829 --> 00:02:38.028
"Let's have a picnic," Gardener said.

30
00:02:38.029 --> 00:02:43.376
"Let's take a nap," the stable boy said.

31
00:02:43.377 --> 00:02:54.895
Tom walked away.

32
00:02:54.896 --> 00:02:57.604
"Cat," he whispered.

33
00:02:57.605 --> 00:03:05.867
"We have to stop Dirk!"

